plug_ins.description:
List of plugin references (bean IDs) to inject into broker
Items must be objects with 'ref' string property
Items: { ref: string }

transport_connectors.description:
List of transport endpoints for client connections (e.g., OpenWire, MQTT, STOMP)
Items must be objects with name, protocol, host, port, wire_format_opts properties
Items: { name: string, protocol: string, host: string, port: number, wire_format_opts: list }

network_connectors.description:
Optional list of network connectors to bridge to other brokers
Items must be objects with name, uri, dynamic_only, prefetch, decrease_priority properties
Items: { name: string, uri: string, dynamic_only: bool, prefetch: number, decrease_priority: bool }

destination_policy_entries.description:
List of destination-specific policies (queues/topics) to control behavior
Items must be objects with queue, topic, dead_letter_queue, memory_limit_mb, max_entries, use_cache, expire_period_ms, inactive_timeout, gc_inactive_destinations, dispatch_policy, max_producers_audit, max_consumers_audit properties
Items: { queue: string, topic: string, dead_letter_queue: string, memory_limit_mb: number, max_entries: number, use_cache: bool, expire_period_ms: number, inactive_timeout: number, gc_inactive_destinations: bool, dispatch_policy: string, max_producers_audit: number, max_consumers_audit: number }

auth_rules.description:
Authorization rules mapping destination patterns to roles
Items must be objects with type, queue, topic, group, read, write, admin properties
Items: { type: string, queue: string, topic: string, group: string, read: list, write: list, admin: list }
